{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29d9fc103eeac9828ba9c927b45c62f96a4c8ae51845dbd5cf503b6e2662c4aa", "ja": "（雑誌社から、今回のツアーのアンケートが届いて\nいる。海美がまだ提出してないけど……大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（杂志社寄来了这次巡演的问卷。海美还没提交……没问题吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "57154a46295934a266a7111260cacaf4a7d936cc03e1ec87571d478ff7712809", "ja": "あっ、この写真……そうそう、こんなのもあったっけ！\nうーっ、どれも楽しかったなぁ。", "zh": "啊，这张照片……对了对了，好像还有这种的呢！\n呜——每一张都好开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "842262e71a1551ace74370c60975659b152d4d2914d7b3fb8c564a604da05ff0", "ja": "おーい海美、ちょっといいか？\nほら、この前渡したアンケート、そろそろなんだけど。", "zh": "喂，海美，方便吗？你看，之前交给你的那份问卷，也差不多该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "807709d7cddc89484b6a5b7a839f416b8b662d46702bd665d6a25e864f0933ae", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nそれなら、今、書いてたとこ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n说到那个，我刚好正在填写呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "973c80d931eb0888e4b1f0be0f0a645b91b59c7324eedb7717a1c8fa5d871af9", "ja": "どんなことがあったか思い出すのに、\nツアーの写真を見ながら書いてたんだ。", "zh": "我是在一边看巡演的照片，一边写发生过什么来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1005_p", "source_sha256": "302638d4dd538c6279d5e2503247989fc710222190fbe7bfbee97fb4523e54e1", "ja": "お、そうだったのか！　それなら……あれ？\nまだ白紙みたいだけど……。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊！那样的话……咦？\n好像还是一片空白呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "18a7fa8cadbf1718ac65af7242ce7d7bb31a068c92c813a8d98f619f7a98e71c", "ja": "えへへ、それが……どれ書こうか迷っちゃうの！\n食べ物もおいしくて、楽しいこといっぱいで……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，那个……我在犹豫该写哪一个呢！\n食物也很好吃，还有好多开心的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "c1e4a74f26a694e53f5b997b6ed5a38a20898b94c93497accd45de26cc8545a2", "ja": "みんなで見た夜景とか、もうすっごく\n綺麗で……うーっ、決められないよーっ！", "zh": "大家一起看的夜景也是，真的超级\n漂亮……呜——，根本选不出来啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2232209b375f041daab22d195e58cf0e9b55750d87bbd15966e724c018d76eef", "ja": "なるほど……。\nそういう事なら、用紙の裏も使っていいよ。", "zh": "原来如此……。\n既然这样，那用纸的背面也可以哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "ecb7a53278b308379f6e311f7f87dda1c4ff5d1f1e32b1dcdda00774fe675003", "ja": "えっ？　裏も……？", "zh": "诶？背面也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1010_p", "source_sha256": "289baa1266fed73e2ef9faab728e941e133938885b1b773089f49244263646fd", "ja": "思い出が多すぎるって言うなら、\n全部使って書いたらいいんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "要是觉得回忆太多，那就把它们全部用来写不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "4efcbea5f6dee1ef030c365d2df8798132ad40a4b8593c75dfc60f8b1881eba0", "ja": "たしかに！　そうすれば迷わなくていいかも？\nありがと、{$P$}！", "zh": "确实！那样的话，或许就不用烦恼了吧？\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "2cacfe4fd92bba3af0d5343357eaec62be0c1c67feb0ac144c36fa9c13c6c7fd", "ja": "よーし、それじゃ最初の公演から振り返って……。", "zh": "好，那就从第一场公演开始回顾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0303_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "31576234705351fe038dbd09693bf1c88e7aa386182def98fe2eb42ae5a2d701", "ja": "ごめーん、{$P$}！\n用紙足りなくなっちゃった！　もう1枚追加していい？", "zh": "对不起——{$P$}！\n纸不够了！再加1张可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
